HxRoute119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "The BOSS got interested in\n"
    .string "the research they have going here,\l"
    .string "so he sent us out.\p"
    .string "You quit meddling!$"

HxRoute119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Blast it…\n"
    .string "Blasted by a kid…$"

HxRoute119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "Our BOSS knows everything.\p"
    .string "But I'm just a GRUNT. What would I know\n"
    .string "about what he's thinking?$"

HxRoute119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt4Intro::
    .string "Huh?\n"
    .string "What's a kid doing here?$"

HxRoute119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt4Defeat::
    .string "Huh?\n"
    .string "I lost?!$"

HxRoute119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt4PostBattle::
    .string "Oh, no…\n"
    .string "I'll catch an earful for losing to a kid…\p"
    .string "I should just take a nap in the bed…$"

HxRoute119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_EveryoneWentUpstairs::
    .string "While I was sleeping, everyone went\n"
    .string "upstairs!$"

HxRoute119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_TakeRestInBed::
    .string "There's a bed…\n"
    .string "Let's take a rest.$"

